data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-p10-lifecycle","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_006390ce6001zHCgSE2WPnJ2tc","role":"user","content":"分两步：1) 用 render_a2ui 渲染 surfaceId=p10-board 的看板（一个 MetricCard 总销售额 ¥1,286,242）2) 然后再调一次 render_a2ui，surfaceId 还是 p10-board、components 传空数组，把它关闭。两步都要执行。"},{"id":"msg_006390d3a001FVoOiAndp5KhOr-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to do two steps:\n1. Render a dashboard with render_a2ui, surfaceId=p10-board, with a MetricCard showing total sales ¥1,286,242\n2. Call render_a2ui again with same surfaceId but empty components array to close it\n\nBoth steps must be executed. Step 2 depends on step 1 (closing after rendering), but actually they're independent calls - I should do step 1 first, then step 2. Actually the user says \"分两步\" (two steps), and both must be executed. Step 2 closes the board after step 1 shows it.\n\nLet me do them in sequence. Actually they could be done in parallel since closing with empty array would just close it. But the user wants the board rendered first then closed. Since both calls are independent in terms of tool inputs, I could batch them. But the user explicitly says two steps. Let me just do both calls. They're independent, so I can do them in parallel in a single message.\n\nActually, step 1 creates the board, step 2 closes it. They don't depend on each other's outputs. I'll batch both in parallel."},{"id":"msg_006390d3a001FVoOiAndp5KhOr","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_QQq78cHUNHLdhiINyUer1580","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"p10-board\",\"components\":[{\"component\":\"MetricCard\",\"id\":\"sales\",\"title\":\"总销售额\",\"value\":\"¥1,286,242\"}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_QQq78cHUNHLdhiINyUer1580","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_QQq78cHUNHLdhiINyUer1580","content":"Surface NOT rendered — gateway rejected it: missing root component (a component with id=\"root\" is required). Do NOT claim it was rendered. Fix the components (whitelist: Text,Image,Icon,Video,AudioPlayer,Row,Column,List,Card,Tabs,Divider,Modal,Button,TextField,CheckBox,ChoicePicker,Slider,DateTimeInput,MetricCard,DataTable,BarChart,LineChart,PieChart,InsightCard,WarningCard,ActionButton,Badge,Markdown) and call render_a2ui again."},{"id":"msg_0063927a2001ZczoUuvNfq1s2z-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The render failed because I'm missing a root component with id=\"root\". I need to wrap the MetricCard. Let me fix: a Card with child being the MetricCard, or use Column. The root component must have id=\"root\". Let me use a Column with id=\"root\" containing the MetricCard."},{"id":"msg_0063927a2001ZczoUuvNfq1s2z","role":"assistant","content":"第一次调用失败（缺 root 组件），修复后重试：","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_txtPrvxCH2zjLwrw5e131873","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"sales\"],\"justify\":\"start\"},{\"component\":\"MetricCard\",\"id\":\"sales\",\"title\":\"总销售额\",\"value\":\"¥1,286,242\"}],\"surfaceId\":\"p10-board\"}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_txtPrvxCH2zjLwrw5e131873","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_txtPrvxCH2zjLwrw5e131873","content":"UI surface \"p10-board\" rendered (2 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_006392f44001Pj0p3itRT6TzpQ","role":"assistant","content":"步骤1完成，现在关闭看板：","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_ET_yVk1kFEZAzvSCcdfp7684278","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"components\":[],\"surfaceId\":\"p10-board\"}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_ET_yVk1kFEZAzvSCcdfp7684278","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_ET_yVk1kFEZAzvSCcdfp7684278","content":"components 不能为空"},{"id":"msg_006393493001OYNMt7YZXbEtSu-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user said to pass an empty array to close it, but the tool rejects empty array. Let me check the docs: \"components 传空数组 = 关闭该 surface（从聊天中移除看板）\". But the tool says components 不能为空. Hmm. Let me try again — maybe the gateway rejected it. Let me retry with the empty array. Actually the error message says components cannot be empty. But the render_a2ui description explicitly says empty array closes the surface. Maybe there's a validation issue. Let me try again — perhaps it was a transient error. Or perhaps I should try passing empty array again.\n\nLet me retry."},{"id":"msg_006393493001OYNMt7YZXbEtSu","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_kkIwWrkI7smfnmghMawk6283","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"components\":[],\"surfaceId\":\"p10-board\"}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_kkIwWrkI7smfnmghMawk6283","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_kkIwWrkI7smfnmghMawk6283","content":"components 不能为空"},{"id":"msg_006393bf1001JBg7iAmhfzK7Al-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The tool rejects empty arrays even though the docs say empty array closes the surface. Let me report honestly. The user explicitly wanted two steps executed: render then close with empty array. I executed both; the close step failed because the gateway rejects empty arrays. I should report this honestly and not claim the close succeeded.\n\nPerhaps there's an alternative way to close. But the instruction says empty array = close. The tool rejected it. I should inform the user. I can't fabricate success."},{"id":"msg_006393bf1001JBg7iAmhfzK7Al","role":"assistant","content":"两步均已执行，但结果如下：\n- 步骤1 渲染成功：`p10-board` 看板已显示（MetricCard 总销售额 ¥1,286,242）。\n- 步骤2 关闭失败：`components: []` 被网关拒绝，返回 \"components 不能为空\"，看板仍处于显示状态。\n\n需确认关闭 surface 的正确方式（例如通过移除 surface 的专用操作），需要我继续尝试其他方法关闭吗？"}]}

